---
layout: layouts/base.njk
seoTitle: Cat Adoption Application | Feline Fairies, St. Augustine
title: Cat Adoption Application
description: Read what to know before applying to adopt a cat through Feline Fairies in St. Augustine and complete the official adoption application.
pageStyles:
  - /assets/css/interior.css
  - /assets/css/forms.css
---


<section class="application-opening">

  <div class="shell">

    <p class="eyebrow">
      Adoption / Application
    </p>

    <h1>
      Let’s get
      <em>acquainted.</em>
    </h1>

    <p>
      Complete Feline Fairies’ official application below. You can apply for a specific cat or ask us to help you find a match.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>



<section class="application-prep">

  <div class="shell application-prep__grid">

    <h2>
      Before you begin
    </h2>

    <ul>

      <li>
        Applicants must be 18 or older.
      </li>

      <li>
        You can apply before choosing a specific cat.
      </li>

      <li>
        An application starts a conversation and does not reserve a cat.
      </li>

    </ul>

  </div>

</section>



<section
  class="application-form"
  id="application"
>

  <div class="shell">

    <div class="application-form__head">

      <div>

        <p class="eyebrow">
          Official application
        </p>

        <h2>
          Apply to adopt.
        </h2>

      </div>

      <p>
        The form is provided by Jotform and is reviewed by the Feline Fairies volunteer team.
      </p>

    </div>


    {% set formConfig = forms.adoption %}
    {% set formSize = "long" %}
    {% include "components/form-embed.njk" %}

  </div>

</section>



<section class="application-next">

  <div class="shell application-next__grid">

    <div>

      <p class="eyebrow">
        What happens next
      </p>

      <h2>
        We’ll be in touch.
      </h2>

    </div>


    <div>

      <p>
        Our volunteer adoptions team reviews applications and follows up about next steps. If the match seems right, a meet-and-greet can be arranged after approval.
      </p>

      <a
        class="button button--night"
        href="/adopt/"
        style="margin-top:25px"
      >
        Browse the Cats
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>